    {
      "id": "climate_resilience",
      "desc": "Focus on climate-vulnerable areas using 65-year SPEI-12 drought characterisation and phenological trend analysis.  GSL trend identifies areas where growing seasons are shortening; greenup variability flags unreliable planting.",
